	documentation 	
|We will try to identify Design Patterns as described by Erich Gamma, Richard Helm, Ralph Johnson and John Vlissides.
|
|Each class will recieve a pattern adornment if its pattern is identified.
|
|Identified are:
| - fly weight
| - facade
| - adapter
| - factory
| - singleton
| - iterators
|- strategy
|
|The development process will be top down and bottom up.
|
|Tasks this week
|Sequence diagrams:
| - Identify diagrams that need to created
|State Machines:
| - Wizards are prime candidates
| - Model Integrity Checking
| - Analysis Types
| - File I/O
	
